+
+## Journal route ownership
+
+Journal at `/journal/` and `/journal/[slug]/` reads the existing Posts collection at request time. Posts owns title, excerpt, Portable Text content and publication state; the Journal template retains field edit proxies and the original RichText value. The active primary CMS menu and seed include Journal. Existing `/posts` and `/posts/[slug]` remain available. This scoped addition reuses the current art direction, tokens, collection-list and article-stack composition without visual recalibration.
